description:
In /Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid/public/graph.html, complete the node label wrapping fix started in the main session. The wrapLabel function and NW/NH_BASE/NH_EXTRA/CHARS_PER_LINE/nodeLabel/nodeLines/nodeH constants are already added. Now need to:

1. Replace the static rect/text enter selection (lines ~4912-4916) — change rects to use data-driven heights (nodeH(t)), add fttl2 text element for line 2.
2. Update the merge selection (na) — update rect y/height attrs, set fttl y based on line count, set fttl2 content and y, update fst y, remove old hardcoded truncate call on line 4922.

Exact changes needed in the enter selection block:
```
  en.append('rect').attr('class','fhalo').attr('rx',11).attr('fill','none').attr('stroke','#58a6ff');
  en.append('rect').attr('class','fbg').attr('rx',8).attr('x',-NW/2);
  en.append('rect').attr('class','flbar').attr('width',4).attr('x',-NW/2);
  en.append('text').attr('class','fttl').attr('x',-NW/2+12);
  en.append('text').attr('class','fttl2').attr('x',-NW/2+12);
  en.append('text').attr('class','fst').attr('x',-NW/2+12);
```
(replace the existing 5 en.append lines that use hardcoded NH)

In the merge (na) block, after na is defined, add/update:
```
  na.select('.fhalo').attr('x',t=>-NW/2-4).attr('y',t=>-nodeH(t)/2-4).attr('width',NW+8).attr('height',t=>nodeH(t)+8);
  na.select('.fbg').attr('width',NW).attr('height',t=>nodeH(t)).attr('y',t=>-nodeH(t)/2);
  na.select('.flbar').attr('height',t=>nodeH(t)).attr('y',t=>-nodeH(t)/2);
```

For the fttl/fttl2/fst text in na (replace the existing na.select('.fttl')... line and na.select('.fst')... line):
```
  na.select('.fttl').attr('fill','#e6edf3').attr('font-weight',600)
    .attr('y',t=>nodeLines(t).length>1 ? -nodeH(t)/2+18 : -2)
    .text(t=>nodeLines(t)[0]);
  na.select('.fttl2').attr('fill','#e6edf3').attr('font-weight',600).attr('font-size',13)
    .attr('y',t=>nodeLines(t).length>1 ? -nodeH(t)/2+34 : 0)
    .attr('opacity',t=>nodeLines(t).length>1?1:0)
    .text(t=>{ const ls=nodeLines(t); return ls.length>1?ls.slice(1).join(' '):''; });
  na.select('.fst').attr('fill',t=>STATUS_COLOR[t.status]||'#8b949e')
    .attr('y',t=>nodeLines(t).length>1 ? nodeH(t)/2-10 : 16)
    .text(t=>(t.kind==='note'?(t.validTo?'superseded':(t.supersedes?'current ✓':'note')):t.status.replace('_',' '))+(t.agent_id?' ▶'+t.agent_id:''));
```

Must call start_task before editing. Task key will be provided by the orchestrator after TaskCreate.
